          "headline": "Sara Duterte’s impeachment trial opens in the Senate",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-06&search=Sara%20Duterte%E2%80%99s%20impeachment%20trial%20opens%20in%20the%20Senate",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Senate opened Sara Duterte’s impeachment trial on July 6, with the vice president represented by lawyers. Prosecutors began presenting a case involving alleged misuse of funds, unexplained wealth and threats against the president; she denies wrongdoing. The opening moved the political confrontation into public evidentiary proceedings that overseas Filipinos could follow directly.</p>",
