          "headline": "Marcoleta surrenders after court issues arrest warrant",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-06&search=Marcoleta%20surrenders%20after%20court%20issues%20arrest%20warrant",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Senator Rodante Marcoleta surrendered on July 6 and was taken into police custody following a Sandiganbayan arrest warrant in the ₱75 million plunder case. He denies wrongdoing and had gone to court with his lawyers to contest the proceedings. The arrest was a new step after the prior week’s filing, not a conviction.</p>",
