          "headline": "June inflation slows to 6.4%, but first-half average stays elevated",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-07&search=June%20inflation%20slows%20to%206.4%25%2C%20but%20first-half%20average%20stays%20elevated",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>PSA reported on July 7 that inflation eased to 6.4% in June from 6.8% in May. The first-half average stood at 4.8%, above the BSP’s 2–4% tolerance range. Remittance-supported households therefore still faced broad price increases despite the improvement in the latest monthly reading.</p>",
