          "headline": "Inday and enhanced monsoon strand passengers and put northern responders on alert",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-10&search=Inday%20and%20enhanced%20monsoon%20strand%20passengers%20and%20put%20northern%20responders%20on%20alert",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Coast Guard reported more than 600 people stranded in ports on July 10 as Typhoon Inday affected sea travel. Its enhanced monsoon brought rain to Pangasinan and La Union, where disaster-response teams were on standby. The disruption connected coastal weather risk with practical problems for travelers and families awaiting deliveries.</p>",
