          "headline": "Cebu launch gives women’s basketball an international stage",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-10&search=Cebu%20launch%20gives%20women%E2%80%99s%20basketball%20an%20international%20stage",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Organizers unveiled the 2027 FIBA Women’s Asia Cup branding in Cebu on July 8, and FIBA announced the tournament schedule on July 10. The competition was set for Cebu in July 2027, giving the national women’s program a major home event to prepare for. The launch offered fans at home and overseas a concrete focal point for following women’s basketball.</p>",
